(OP120 - S2 - ROUGH OD REAR: D29.9 SPIGOT, SHOULDER, D60, R5, FLANGE LEFT FACE - T01)
(LEAVES 0.5 MM PER SIDE)
G21 G18 G40 G99 (METRIC, XZ PLANE, COMP OFF, FEED PER REV)
G28 U0 W0 (MACHINE REFERENCE BEFORE TOOL CALL)
T0101 (T01 OD ROUGH)
G97 S500 M03 (500 RPM)
M08 (COOLANT ON)
G00 X110.0 Z2.0 (APPROACH POINT = CYCLE START POINT)
G71 U2.5 R0.5 (RADIAL DEPTH 2.5, RETRACT 0.5)
G71 P200 Q250 U1.0 W0.5 F0.2 (PROFILE N200-N250, FINISH ALLOWANCE)
N200 G00 X29.9 (SPIGOT D29.9)
N210 G01 Z-20.0 (SPIGOT LENGTH 20)
N220 G01 X60.0 (SHOULDER FACE UP TO D60)
N230 G01 Z-55.0 (D60 BODY TO FILLET TANGENT)
N240 G02 X70.0 Z-60.0 R5.0 (CONCAVE R5 FILLET TO FLANGE LEFT FACE)
N250 G01 X106.0 (FLANGE LEFT FACE, END ABOVE STOCK)
G00 X110.0 Z2.0 (APPROACH POINT)
M09 (COOLANT OFF)
G28 U0 W0 (RETURN TO REFERENCE)
M05 (SPINDLE STOP)
M30 (END OF PROGRAM)
